WEBVTT

00:09.570 --> 00:14.410
Test results, magic Circles, 
and family histories.

00:15.680 --> 00:20.100
We've assigned classes thusly 
based on these elements.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.920
As expected, there's not a single 
commoner assigned to the alpha class.

00:25.920 --> 00:27.820
Of course not.

00:27.820 --> 00:32.020
The alpha class exists to 
nurture the chosen mages.

00:32.020 --> 00:37.180
We can't afford to accept 
uneducated commoners there.

00:37.640 --> 00:39.520
Exactly.

00:39.520 --> 00:44.440
Commoners should be happy that they 
get to enroll in Hebrion Academy at all.

00:50.680 --> 00:52.190
Silence.

00:56.020 --> 00:59.130
The placement is completed, 
but there has been a recommendation

00:59.130 --> 01:02.410
that a certain student 
be placed in the alpha class.

01:02.980 --> 01:06.500
Isn't that right, Professor Brigitte?

01:09.020 --> 01:09.810
That's correct.

01:14.780 --> 01:16.590
Desir Herrman.

01:17.060 --> 01:20.550
I believe he should be 
placed in the alpha class.

01:35.160 --> 01:36.790
Yes! I'm in alpha!

01:36.790 --> 01:37.930
Obviously.

01:37.930 --> 01:39.410
We're born for that.

01:47.540 --> 01:48.850
<i>Beta, huh?</i>

01:50.040 --> 01:51.750
<i>But I'm more concerned about...</i>

01:57.140 --> 01:58.220
No way...

02:14.860 --> 02:22.030
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

02:24.400 --> 02:31.180
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

02:31.180 --> 02:33.750
<i>A stolen smile</i>

02:33.750 --> 02:43.130
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

02:43.130 --> 02:47.760
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

02:47.760 --> 02:52.180
<i>For the final challenge</i>

02:52.180 --> 02:55.610
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:55.610 --> 03:01.810
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

03:01.810 --> 03:05.150
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

03:05.150 --> 03:12.200
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

03:12.200 --> 03:14.530
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

03:14.530 --> 03:17.170
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

03:17.170 --> 03:22.010
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

03:22.010 --> 03:24.340
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

03:24.340 --> 03:26.970
<i>To my own story</i>

03:31.980 --> 03:36.860
<b>  Comrades</b>

03:31.980 --> 03:36.860
<b></b>Episode 3

03:46.060 --> 03:48.250
<i>Run-down classrooms.</i>

03:51.190 --> 03:53.720
<i>Musty interiors.</i>

03:55.720 --> 03:58.000
<i>When, exactly, was this place built?</i>

03:58.000 --> 04:00.110
<i>Jeez...</i>

04:00.550 --> 04:05.730
Uh, the skills of mages 
are ranked in Circles.

04:06.430 --> 04:11.530
The lowest Circle is one, 
the highest Circle is seven.

04:11.940 --> 04:15.850
In the entrance exam, 
they place weight on your Circle.

04:15.850 --> 04:21.200
To be in the alpha class,
 you need to be at least Circle 2.

04:21.200 --> 04:23.330
All of you here are...

04:24.390 --> 04:26.330
Circle 1.

04:26.720 --> 04:28.500
<i>I'm Circle 2!</i>

04:28.500 --> 04:33.340
Your skills probably won't be good 
enough for real Shadow Worlds,

04:33.700 --> 04:35.650
but best of luck to you.

04:37.160 --> 04:39.300
<i>What are you laughing about?!</i>

04:42.070 --> 04:47.060
<i>Did I not get chosen for the 
alpha class... because of that?</i>

04:50.040 --> 04:53.050
<i>Being in beta is bad enough...</i>

04:54.800 --> 04:58.420
<i>But why do I have to be 
in the same class as him?</i>

04:58.420 --> 04:59.950
<i>Not to mention sitting next to him?!</i>

05:00.670 --> 05:03.160
<i>He beat the magic knight, didn't he?</i>

05:03.160 --> 05:06.020
<i>So why is he here?</i>

05:06.020 --> 05:08.210
<i>Jeez, I don't get it!</i>

05:11.420 --> 05:13.840
<i>What are you smiling about?!</i>

05:15.640 --> 05:17.660
Wh-Wh-Wh-What's the matter?!

05:17.660 --> 05:19.510
Is something wrong?!

05:19.510 --> 05:21.450
It's nothing!

05:27.470 --> 05:29.520
<i>Beta class, huh?</i>

05:34.760 --> 05:37.670
It's been a while, Desir Herrman.

05:38.130 --> 05:42.180
Thank you for all you did at the 
orphanage, Professor Brigitte.

05:42.650 --> 05:45.280
I'm happy you remember me,

05:45.670 --> 05:49.130
and that you grew up to be an excellent mage.

05:52.740 --> 05:57.750
No one even imagined 
 you could beat Azest.

05:58.710 --> 06:02.190
I wish I could have placed
 you in the alpha class...

06:02.760 --> 06:05.760
but the professors, as nobles, 
strongly opposed the idea.

06:06.470 --> 06:07.640
I'm sorry.

06:09.240 --> 06:12.300
<i>They set up a wall between 
nobility and commoners.</i>

06:12.300 --> 06:15.980
<i>But... their obsession with status means...</i>

06:16.900 --> 06:18.390
<i>It's not just me.</i>

06:18.390 --> 06:20.960
<i>There are many diamonds in the rough here.</i>

06:25.340 --> 06:28.190
<i>I must awaken as many talents as possible.</i>

06:29.230 --> 06:31.050
<i>No matter what it takes.</i>

06:47.220 --> 06:49.580
I can't believe I'm in beta.

06:51.800 --> 06:52.680
Excuse me.

06:52.680 --> 06:57.090
Are you the daughter of Baron Eru,
 Ms. Romantica Eru?

06:57.810 --> 06:59.250
I am.

06:59.250 --> 07:00.650
Who are you?

07:00.990 --> 07:03.030
I'm Doneta Hadoon.

07:03.860 --> 07:07.580
I'm a new student like yourself, 
though I'm in the alpha class.

07:07.910 --> 07:09.410
Oh.

07:09.790 --> 07:12.660
I'm actually looking for party members.

07:13.160 --> 07:15.670
I hope you find good ones.

07:16.170 --> 07:18.170
That's why I came here.

07:18.560 --> 07:21.550
I'm going to be joining Blue Moon.

07:23.060 --> 07:25.050
Blue Moon? You mean...

07:25.550 --> 07:29.820
The best party in this academy, made up 
of the top students of the alpha class.

07:30.750 --> 07:35.190
I came to invite you, since you have 
excellent skills and a perfect lineage,

07:35.190 --> 07:36.220
Romantica.

07:39.650 --> 07:42.510
<i>If I join, I might be promoted 
to the alpha class.</i>

07:42.910 --> 07:45.030
<i>Then my answer is clear.</i>

07:46.500 --> 07:47.570
<i>But...</i>

07:52.760 --> 07:53.820
However...

07:54.640 --> 07:57.250
in exchange for recommending 
you for the party...

07:58.030 --> 07:59.780
I want you to go out with me.

08:00.090 --> 08:01.130
Huh?

08:04.580 --> 08:06.870
What?! Wait...

08:06.870 --> 08:09.050
Wh-What are you talking—

08:09.050 --> 08:10.510
I'm serious.

08:10.510 --> 08:13.680
But, but, but, but... we've only met today!

08:13.680 --> 08:15.570
I saw you at the entrance ceremony.

08:15.570 --> 08:16.810
It's love at first sight.

08:18.380 --> 08:20.650
It's unthinkable that 
a brilliant noble like you

08:20.650 --> 08:25.650
should be lumped into the beta class 
with filthy commoners.

08:26.070 --> 08:27.790
I want you to come with me.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.570
C-Can you give me some time to think?

08:37.650 --> 08:38.830
Of course.

08:39.540 --> 08:40.620
Oh, right.

08:41.380 --> 08:42.710
This is for you.

08:44.990 --> 08:46.190
It's a kemuvin.

08:46.730 --> 08:51.410
In my hometown, it's customary to gift 
this to someone you're in love with.

08:57.460 --> 08:58.630
Open it.

09:02.590 --> 09:03.940
What?

09:04.450 --> 09:07.450
I-I couldn't take this...

09:08.480 --> 09:10.110
It's proof of my sincerity.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.130
Please take it.

09:15.130 --> 09:17.330
I hope to hear a favorable answer.

09:26.330 --> 09:27.710
Not too shabby.

09:35.560 --> 09:37.110
Nice reaction.

09:37.110 --> 09:39.190
Don't ambush me like that!

09:39.190 --> 09:40.200
Can you stand?

09:40.200 --> 09:41.610
Of course I can!

09:45.020 --> 09:46.730
So, what do you want?

09:47.400 --> 09:50.240
I have the same proposal for you that he did.

09:50.240 --> 09:51.400
Bleh!

09:51.400 --> 09:53.590
Who would go out with <i>you</i>?!

09:53.590 --> 09:54.740
There's no way.

09:54.740 --> 09:56.740
Not that proposal.

09:56.740 --> 09:58.690
Would you like to join my party?

09:58.690 --> 10:00.400
That's even worse!

10:00.400 --> 10:04.210
The best party in the academy, 
where success is guaranteed,

10:04.210 --> 10:07.520
against a party created by 
a new student in the beta class?

10:07.520 --> 10:09.260
Which do you think I'd choose?

10:10.140 --> 10:13.630
<i>That was the biggest mistake you made.</i>

10:14.510 --> 10:17.040
If I've made myself clear, then get lost!

10:17.040 --> 10:18.850
I don't have any business with you!

10:19.800 --> 10:21.610
I guess I have no choice.

10:21.610 --> 10:23.080
Here you go.

10:25.100 --> 10:26.110
What's that?

10:26.480 --> 10:29.070
Read it when no one's around.

10:34.460 --> 10:36.800
What, it's for me?

10:36.800 --> 10:39.250
What kind of embarrassing 
things did you write?

10:39.250 --> 10:40.960
My goodness...

10:40.960 --> 10:44.960
I recommend you get rid 
of it after you read it.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.770
It's for your sake.

10:46.770 --> 10:47.840
Huh?

10:49.510 --> 10:51.280
You can give me your answer later.

10:55.210 --> 10:56.580
What the...?

11:09.180 --> 11:11.050
How did he...?

11:15.990 --> 11:18.760
Will she get mad, or will she cry?

11:19.570 --> 11:21.740
Well, I bet she'll get mad.

11:37.640 --> 11:38.950
I found you.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.520
<i>Pram Schnaizer.</i>

12:00.840 --> 12:04.560
<i>Among the warriors who participated in 
that battle before my return here,</i>

12:04.560 --> 12:06.990
<i>he was one of the fastest swordsmen.</i>

12:07.790 --> 12:12.130
<i>He was that strong in a timeline 
where he barely had any training.</i>

12:12.520 --> 12:14.610
<i>This time, he can be much stronger.</i>

12:15.240 --> 12:16.490
Found you!

12:24.380 --> 12:25.920
Where the hell did you learn about—

12:25.920 --> 12:27.980
Hush. The practice is starting.

12:27.980 --> 12:29.770
The practice?

12:37.990 --> 12:40.410
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is that life form?!

12:40.410 --> 12:42.050
Too adorable!

12:42.050 --> 12:44.860
I guess Pram is kind of cute.

12:44.860 --> 12:46.460
Kind of?!

12:46.460 --> 12:48.280
That's pure cuteness!

12:48.280 --> 12:49.860
A cutie like that exists here?

12:49.860 --> 12:53.170
Is this paradise? Was it paradise all along?

12:55.220 --> 12:56.170
Achoo!

12:57.130 --> 12:58.880
I can't! I wanna keep him!

12:58.880 --> 13:00.620
What do I do?!

13:18.650 --> 13:20.940
A great sword? Why...

13:21.690 --> 13:24.160
Can he really wield such a large weapon?

13:30.720 --> 13:33.710
I'm Pram Schnaizer, from the beta class.

13:34.630 --> 13:37.090
I don't need to announce 
my name for a mere beta.

13:38.020 --> 13:39.470
Get us started already.

13:39.470 --> 13:40.990
O-Oh, okay.

13:42.850 --> 13:43.860
Ready...

13:45.410 --> 13:46.420
begin!

13:56.730 --> 13:58.190
Damn!

14:00.240 --> 14:01.490
You bastard...!

14:07.330 --> 14:09.730
He's actually pretty strong!

14:09.730 --> 14:10.790
No.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.610
<i>He's just swinging it around blindly.</i>

14:14.090 --> 14:16.130
<i>Why is he using a great sword?</i>

14:23.240 --> 14:24.820
<i>The attacks are coming non-stop.</i>

14:25.130 --> 14:27.310
<i>But, knowing Pram, he'll...</i>

14:31.110 --> 14:32.110
Hold it!

14:52.900 --> 14:54.240
I yield.

14:55.150 --> 14:56.270
Match over!

14:56.270 --> 14:57.750
Percival wins!

15:00.300 --> 15:03.150
He did his best, but he lost anyway.

15:03.620 --> 15:06.420
But why did he choose a great sword?

15:06.420 --> 15:07.950
It didn't work for him, right?

15:08.490 --> 15:09.450
Right...

15:17.520 --> 15:18.710
Don't!

15:35.660 --> 15:37.420
The match is over!

15:38.180 --> 15:39.230
Shut up.

15:39.230 --> 15:41.310
Do you want to end up like him?

15:42.060 --> 15:44.760
His blow landed that hard, did it?

15:45.970 --> 15:50.220
Or are you jealous of someone 
who's more talented than you?

15:51.680 --> 15:54.430
Shut up!

16:05.780 --> 16:07.320
You... blocked it?!

16:08.150 --> 16:10.230
You won the match.

16:11.590 --> 16:14.080
What more do you want?

16:19.920 --> 16:21.890
I'm going to remember your face!

16:35.260 --> 16:37.440
A-Are you okay?

16:37.440 --> 16:40.090
Yeah, I used magic to block it.

16:40.090 --> 16:41.750
It didn't do much damage.

16:42.380 --> 16:47.470
Just like at the entrance exam, 
you are really reckless!

16:47.470 --> 16:48.860
I'm done!

16:54.880 --> 16:56.670
I'm so sorry.

16:57.150 --> 17:00.130
Your right arm... it'll inconvenience 
you for a while, I'm sure.

17:00.130 --> 17:02.130
I chose to get involved.

17:02.130 --> 17:03.880
You don't need to blame yourself.

17:04.200 --> 17:10.030
But because of me, you made an enemy 
of someone from the alpha class...

17:10.890 --> 17:13.240
How are you so cute when you're crying?!

17:13.240 --> 17:15.520
Romantica, restrain yourself.

17:16.140 --> 17:18.030
I'm really all right.

17:20.490 --> 17:23.520
Oh! I haven't introduced myself.

17:24.260 --> 17:27.030
I'm Pram Schnaizer.

17:27.030 --> 17:27.590
I'm D—

17:27.590 --> 17:29.480
I'm Romantica Eru!

17:30.780 --> 17:32.160
Right...

17:32.860 --> 17:34.750
I'm Desir Herrman.

17:34.750 --> 17:36.690
Nice to meet you, Mr. Schnaizer.

17:38.600 --> 17:40.920
If you don't mind, I'd love it 
if you'd use my first name...

17:40.920 --> 17:42.170
Pram.

17:42.170 --> 17:43.390
Right...

17:45.040 --> 17:47.030
Okay, then... Mr. Pram.

17:48.170 --> 17:50.360
Please don't be so formal!

17:50.360 --> 17:52.680
O-Okay... Pram.

17:55.550 --> 17:59.810
<i>Pram, Pram, Pram, Pram...</i>

18:02.610 --> 18:05.200
<i>Why is he blushing?</i>

18:05.200 --> 18:07.550
<i>But he looks happy, so whatever.</i>

18:10.920 --> 18:14.430
I can't thank you enough, Desir!

18:14.950 --> 18:18.130
I will never forget your kindness.

18:18.580 --> 18:21.860
If there's anything I can do, 
please feel free to tell me!

18:22.210 --> 18:25.210
Yes, I'll be sure to take you up on that.

18:25.210 --> 18:26.230
Of course!

18:26.650 --> 18:27.670
Goodbye!

18:33.800 --> 18:36.700
My gosh, that was so cute!

18:36.700 --> 18:38.330
So, Romantica.

18:39.710 --> 18:41.560
You wanted to talk to me?

18:45.370 --> 18:47.440
Shall we go somewhere else?

18:53.310 --> 18:56.200
You didn't tell anyone about this, did you?!

18:56.200 --> 18:57.520
Of course not.

18:58.100 --> 19:00.680
But the professors here are aware of it.

19:01.420 --> 19:04.500
That's why you were 
dropped to the beta class,

19:04.500 --> 19:06.860
even though you're a noble 
with amazing magic skills.

19:08.480 --> 19:12.500
In Prillecha Kingdom, which lies several 
hundred kilometers away from here,

19:13.200 --> 19:16.430
there lived a merchant who 
made a fortune through trading.

19:17.680 --> 19:22.270
The commoner merchant bought 
a title from a poor noble

19:22.270 --> 19:24.050
and obtained the surname of Eru.

19:24.590 --> 19:26.690
This was when you were about four years old.

19:27.420 --> 19:29.190
Romantica Eru.

19:30.240 --> 19:33.350
"Even if you buy a noble title,
 you can't change your commoner blood."

19:34.450 --> 19:36.750
That's what the professors here think.

19:37.690 --> 19:39.990
That's why you were placed in the beta class.

19:39.990 --> 19:41.550
I know that!

19:41.550 --> 19:43.430
You should decline that offer.

19:44.020 --> 19:46.620
The Blue Moon party is only open to nobles.

19:46.620 --> 19:48.710
I'm sure Doneta will protect me!

19:49.520 --> 19:51.960
Remember what he said about commoners?

19:53.860 --> 19:55.930
Filthy commoners...

19:56.420 --> 20:00.360
I'm sure you can imagine what would 
happen if Doneta found out about this.

20:02.170 --> 20:04.130
Would you like to join my party?

20:04.130 --> 20:04.930
If you don't...

20:06.440 --> 20:09.780
If I don't, you'll tell everyone 
that I'm a commoner?

20:09.780 --> 20:11.210
Give me a break!

20:11.210 --> 20:14.360
You'll never succeed with a party 
you blackmail people into joining!

20:14.760 --> 20:17.110
No, I would never do that.

20:17.660 --> 20:19.370
Then what <i>will</i> you do?

20:19.840 --> 20:24.200
If you turn me down, I guess 
I'll have to start it with Pram alone.

20:25.690 --> 20:27.960
Alone with... Pram?!

20:29.960 --> 20:31.460
Desir!

20:32.860 --> 20:34.270
Desir...

20:35.880 --> 20:40.490
Desir...

20:42.020 --> 20:44.020
That's not fair!

20:44.520 --> 20:46.520
What's not fair?

20:46.970 --> 20:50.520
Honestly, I find you super sketchy!

20:52.270 --> 20:54.170
You keep smiling at me for no reason!

20:54.170 --> 20:56.410
You know so much about my family!

20:56.410 --> 20:58.580
You acted recklessly at the entrance exam!

20:58.580 --> 21:00.530
And you beat a magic knight!

21:00.530 --> 21:03.280
More importantly, what's up 
with that inversing spell?!

21:03.280 --> 21:06.290
How can you do that when 
you're at the lower Circle?!

21:07.250 --> 21:09.290
So, what do you say?

21:17.760 --> 21:21.050
Fine! I'll join your party.

21:21.630 --> 21:26.930
And I'm gonna uncover your secret,
 so just you wait.

21:27.340 --> 21:28.340
Okay...

21:29.060 --> 21:31.050
Nice to work with you, Romantica.

21:36.600 --> 21:39.140
That smile of yours really pisses me off.

21:39.140 --> 21:40.230
I know.

21:41.690 --> 21:44.440
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:44.440 --> 21:47.150
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:47.150 --> 21:50.760
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:55.240 --> 22:00.650
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:00.650 --> 22:05.250
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

22:06.000 --> 22:11.370
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:11.370 --> 22:15.800
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:16.150 --> 22:22.320
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:22.320 --> 22:27.580
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:27.580 --> 22:32.610
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:32.610 --> 22:36.820
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:38.330 --> 22:41.100
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:41.100 --> 22:43.790
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:43.790 --> 22:47.300
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:49.170 --> 22:52.010
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:52.010 --> 22:54.590
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:54.590 --> 22:57.300
<i>Because this time</i>

22:57.300 --> 23:01.430
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.520 --> 23:40.030
<b>    Forming
 a Party</b>

23:35.520 --> 23:40.030
<b></b>Episode 4

23:35.850 --> 23:38.420
Next episode, "Forming a Party."
